# Golden test skip list: known divergences between our parser and MRI.
#
# Format: <phase> <version-range> <path-or-glob>[: reason]
#
# - phase: lex or parse
# - version-range:
#     2.7        exact version
#     ..2.6      2.6 and below
#     3.0..      3.0 and above
#     2.0..2.6   2.0 through 2.6
#     *          all versions
# - path relative to repo root, single-* glob per segment
#
# Each entry marks a case where our lex/parse result diverges from MRI's
# `ruby -c` result at the given version. Entries should be removed as the
# parser's version-aware rejection is implemented.

